'''Sushi Island''' (軍艦島 ''[[wikipedia:Hashima Island|Gunkanjima]]'', '''Battleship Island''') is the 13th sub-chapter in [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.7 Update|Version 2.0.7]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is the 6th sub-chapter in the Stories of Legend and is available up to 3★ difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Somewhat difficult, players should be prepared to face groups of enemies at once. Also, enemies have rather high strength magnification. [[Master A.]], [[Le'boin]], [[Dagshund]], [[Teacher Bear]] and other strong enemies appear in this sub-chapter. [[Shrimp Frontier|The last stage]] introduces [[Director Kurosawah]], who has extreme range and attack power.

Sushi Island is very similar to [[Swimming Cats]], just with higher buffs on the enemies. The only exception is the last stage, [[Shrimp Frontier]], where the [[Doge Dark]]s spawn more frequently, [[Celeboodle]] is absent and instead of [[THE SLOTH]], Director Kurosawah takes his place.
{{LegendDiff|150|200|300}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Director Kurosawah]]: A [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]]. Has higher attack power, longer range and a lower attack rate.

